./coarse_sieve 136279841 32 68139920 out32 --found
takes about 72 seconds on a NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 SUPER with 8 GB of GPU memory

./coarse_sieve_wide 136279841 33 68139920 out33 --found --load out32.found.bin --min-depth 33
takes about 4000 seconds (an hour and seven minutes) on the same RTX 280 SUPER

This version of the code should be capable of d=34,
but that will require a T4 on Google Cloud with 16 GB of GPU memory...

The binary out.found.bin files can be converted to text files
in factor.cpp style "certificate" format using the bin2cert utility,
but those are twice as large.

./bin2cert out.found.bin > out.found.cert
